  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional cooperation in radiological preparedness</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt samarbete inom radiologisk beredskap</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genomf&#xf6;rd konferens om nukle&#xe4;r s&#xe4;kerhet i Svarta Havet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implemented conference on nuclear security in the Black Sea region</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till uppr&#xe4;ttandet av Georgiens icke-spridningspolitik genom att bygga upp den professionella kapaciteten hos inhemska intressenter: statliga myndigheter, civilsamh&#xe4;llet, media och det internationella samfundet p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det; med syfte att minska riskerna och motverka k&#xe4;rnvapenspridning. I st&#xf6;det ing&#xe5;r ocks&#xe5; att genomf&#xf6;ra Tbilisis internationella forum f&#xf6;r regional stabilitet &#x2013; om k&#xe4;rns&#xe4;kerhet och icke-spridningsfr&#xe5;gor f&#xf6;r nationella, regionala och internationella intressenter fr&#xe5;n regeringar, akademi och tankesmedjor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for establishment of Georgia&apos;s non-proliferation policy by building the professional capacity of domestic stakeholders: state authorities, civil society, the media and the international community in the field; with the aim to decrease risks and counteract nuclear proliferation.  The support also includes conducting the Tbilisi International Forum for Regional Stability - on nuclear security and non-proliferation issues for national, regional and international stakeholders from governments, academia and think tanks.</narrative>
  </description>
